B.Ie=A.a(s(["Lantern Town keeps its lamps lit for travellers like you. UEC patrols rarely bother us here.","The job board posts woods and city errands \u2014 nests, caches, moonflowers. Come back to turn them in.","My stall trades glimmer for gear \u2014 plating, optics, charms. Ask to trade, or examine the stall beside me."]),t.s)
B.Ih=A.a(s(["Doctor Kaela Osei. Last chance. Hand over the fragments and walk away with your clearance intact.","Station Seven went dark the last time a lattice woke. I will not bury another colony for an alien ghost story.","If you reach the Core, understand this: I am not erasing history. I am choosing the living over the dead."]),t.s)
